{
  "_doc": "Minigame registry (AD-20). id: unique, the scene key is MG_<id>. subject: grade ledger subject. durationSeconds: the shared round timer (30-90). rewards: xp and money (cents) for a perfect round; a lesser score earns a share from minRewardShare up. expectedQuestions: the score counts against at least this many questions and effort is the share tried. topics: learning-engine topics. difficultyRange: allowed 1-5 start difficulty. debug: only listed in ?debug sessions (demos and templates). Titles come from i18n minigame.<id>.title.",
